{
 "_note": "Domain scoping + run narrative for the statewide Fire / Wildland / Cal-JAC / Electrical CPL crosswalk (kb/_build_domain_cpl_crosswalk.py). Companion to kb/occupation_credential_map.json (occupation -> credential) and kb/delta_offering_map.json (occupation -> one college's offerings). This one answers a THIRD question: for a training DOMAIN, does the chain training -> credential -> CPL -> college course -> certificate actually close, statewide? Narrative lives here, not in the generator, so the generator carries no findings.",
 "_authored": "2026-09-09",
