  "statewide_data.js (generated 2026-09-08) — 2,903 exhibits / 2,573 unified titles / 137 CCC-Collaborative",
  "fact-sheet/statewide_recs.js — published statewide credit recommendations (same builder as the public Fact Sheet)",
  "coci_programs_data.js — CCCCO COCI program export 2026-06-17 (29,147 programs / 121 colleges)",
  "kb/statewide_exhibit_categories.json — statewide program-area map, per map.rccd.edu/statewidecpl/",
  "Supabase chatbox_college_courses x college_geo (synced 2026-08-13), queried 2026-09-09 — cached below"
 ],
 "scoping": {
  "_note": "Applied in order; first match wins. The exclusions are load-bearing. The fire list is INHERITED from docs/kb-notes/methodology-area-eligibility-rollup-from-cer.md; the electrical list was added this run after a first pass pulled in ASE A6 automotive electrical (24 adopters) and AP Physics C: Electricity and Magnetism (80 adopters), either of which would have dominated an electrical ranking.",
